  ($g397$pas_ex6_1$g397$, $g398$abcd$g398$, $g399$intermediate$g399$, $g400${"id":"pas_ex6_1","level":"intermediate","group":6,"gord":6,"no":1,"groupTitle":"Oral Development 8","instruction":"A fire broke out yesterday at Chelsea. Look at the notes, then report the incident. Use passive forms. (Choose the best sentence.)","q":"1. fire — department store — 11.00 pm last night","options":["A) A fire was broken out in a department store at 11.00 pm last night.","B) A fire has been broken out in a department store at 11.00 pm last night.","C) A fire broke out in a department store at 11.00 pm last night.","D) A fire is broken out in a department store at 11.00 pm last night."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Break out — неперехідне дієслово, пасиву від нього немає. Це приклад із підручника."}$g400$, 0, $g401$pas_trans$g401$),
