  ($g407$pas_ex6_3$g407$, $g408$abcd$g408$, $g409$intermediate$g409$, $g410${"id":"pas_ex6_3","level":"intermediate","group":6,"gord":6,"no":3,"groupTitle":"Oral Development 8","instruction":"A fire broke out yesterday at Chelsea. Look at the notes, then report the incident. Use passive forms. (Choose the best sentence.)","q":"3. call firefighters — try to put it out","options":["A) The firefighters called and an attempt made to put the fire out.","B) The firefighters were call and an attempt was made to put the fire out.","C) The firefighters were called and an attempt was made to put the fire out.","D) The firefighters were called and they were tried to put the fire out."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Два пасиви: were called і was made. Try — не пасивне в цьому реченні."}$g410$, 2, $g411$pas_trans$g411$),
